/T (Research the visa or residency requirements for your destination country before you leave the U.S. Some countries \(especially in Asia\) require that you apply for a visa before departure. Others, like Portugal, often allow or prefer that you apply after arrival. Your best resource is the official immigration website of the country you're moving to. For real-time insights, connect with people who have already obtained residency via expat-focused Facebook groups or relocation forums. Lived experience often fills in the gaps that official websites leave out.)
/E (Research the visa or residency requirements for your destination country before you leave the U.S. Some countries \(especially in Asia\) require that you apply for a visa before departure. Others, like Portugal, often allow or prefer that you apply after arrival. Your best resource is the official immigration website of the country you're moving to. For real-time insights, connect with people who have already obtained residency via expat-focused Facebook groups or relocation forums. Lived experience often fills in the gaps that official websites leave out.)
