/T ("When I first connected with Tashia I was working for the government and feeling stuck. She told me to look into getting my TEFL and think about teaching abroad. I followed her advice and thank God I did. I moved to Thailand and started teaching kids. Not long after people in my old department lost their jobs. I'm so glad I moved when I did. Honestly I think I was born in the wrong country. Thailand feels like home. These are my people.")
